# Backup decryption key (P1-51, PO decision O47): the age identity that matches BACKUP_AGE_RECIPIENT. Needed only to
# restore, and given only to the `restore` service of the drill project (docker/backup/compose.drill.yaml).
# In production keep it offline, away from the backup host; locally scripts/ops/backup-keys.sh generates it.
BACKUP_AGE_IDENTITY=
